&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Represent the team as a technical expert.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Provide mentorship &amp;amp; guidance for other engineers on the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Tech Stack: Apex, Python, Vue.js, Redis, Google Cloud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
