&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Proficiency with ETL data pipelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Agentic AI experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
