&lt;p data-start="4379" data-end="4513" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node=""&gt;If you want to shape the SoC architecture behind future AI platforms, we’d love to hear from you. Apply now to be part of the journey.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

