arbeitnow:software-engineer-general-lond:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About InstaLILY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://portal.instalily.ai/i/homepage" target="_blank"&gt;InstaLILY&lt;/a&gt; is an AI products and infrastructure company that puts execution at the frontier of enterprise AI. That work begins with &lt;a href="https://portal.instalily.ai/i/lily" target="_blank"&gt;Lily™&lt;/a&gt;, the world's first AI Forward Deployed Engineer, which learns how a business works, builds the software it needs, and goes live in days. It does not leave when the work ships; it stays and keeps the software working as the business changes. Lily runs wherever the work happens, in the cloud, on-premise, or at the edge, through InstaLILY's Small Data Center, built with NVIDIA technology. Founded in 2023 by Amit Shah and Sumantro Das, InstaLILY has raised nearly $100 million from Energize Capital, Insight Partners, and Home Depot Ventures. Headquartered in New York, with offices in San Francisco, London, and Toronto, InstaLILY serves leading companies across construction, industrial distribution, logistics, healthcare, and other operationally intensive industries. Learn more at &lt;a href="https://instalily.ai/" target="_blank"&gt;https://instalily.ai/&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Traction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Revenue grew 5x over the past year, and Lily has driven over $200M in new annual sales for a single customer. We serve some of the largest operators in our industries, including SRS Distribution (part of The Home Depot family), United Rentals, and Henry Schein, and we work closely with the Google DeepMind and NVIDIA ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work in small teams with real ownership: clear problems, direct access to the customers whose work you're changing, and room to ship. Your code runs in live production systems inside billion-dollar operations, so you see your impact directly. People who do well here want that proximity to the work. We're growing fast, and the people who join now shape what this company becomes. Everything runs on three principles: Customers, Culture, and Code.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continue to develop the core AI platform and drive technical excellence throughout the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cross-functional teams (product, UI/UX, business development) to design and implement new features and capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rapidly learn into the expected quality and reliability of the platform through comprehensive testing and continuous integration/continuous delivery (CI/CD) practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a rapport with the Lead Software Engineer and Head of Product while fostering a culture of continuous learning and improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the product and design teams to deliver high-quality products that meet customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up-to-date with the latest AI and software engineering trends and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor's degree in computer science, engineering, Mathematics, Physics or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First Class degree preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;0 to 2 years of experience as a software engineer (prior software engineering internships and experience/projects a significant plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for understanding AI and machine learning technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Python, JavaScript, and other programming languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of cloud computing technologies OR experience with AWS, Azure, or GCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving and analytical skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of delivering successful products / working in a collaborative, fast-paced environment is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You'll Get&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real traction:&lt;/strong&gt; The product works, customers are live, and we've already driven over $200M in incremental revenue for customers — this isn't a bet on an unproven thesis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; Backed by Insight Partners with deep ecosystem partnerships across Google, NVIDIA, and Microsoft. InstaLILY's architecture has been featured in Google DeepMind's case study showcase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer impact:&lt;/strong&gt; You'll drive measurable operational change inside the customers you own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage:&lt;/strong&gt; Early enough to shape how InstaLILY runs customer relationships and expansion at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Offices in New York, San Francisco, and London — sharp, low-ego team moving fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; The learning curve is steep&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Compensation and Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range:&lt;/strong&gt; £48,000–£54,000 per year, commensurate with experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity: &lt;/strong&gt;Generous stock options awards, and refreshers for top performers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits: &lt;/strong&gt;Supplemental benefits, pension contribution, in-office Lunch reimbursement, Wellbeing Stipend, Generous Parental leave, PTO and UK National Holidays, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong class="Yjhzub" data-sfc-root="c" data-sfc-cb="" data-complete="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);"&gt;Quality Over Quantity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure a focused, high-quality hiring experience, we kindly ask candidates to limit their applications to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class="Yjhzub" data-sfc-root="c" data-sfc-cb="" data-complete="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);"&gt;3 open requisitions at any given time&lt;/strong&gt;. Applying strategically to roles that best align with your skills and career goals gives you the highest chance of standing out. Have you interviewed with us in the past 12 months? We encourage you to reach out directly to your previous interviewer rather than submitting a new application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;InstaLILY is committed to providing an inclusive and barrier-free recruitment process. If you require an accommodation, please let us know, and we will work with you to meet your needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:pre-sales-senior-engineer-lond:
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job title:&lt;/strong&gt; Pre-Sales Senior Engineer&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;London/Bristol - Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Commercial&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting To:&lt;/strong&gt; Head of Client Solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role is based in London or Bristol and requires existing right to work in the UK. At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today's challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future. Leveraging Data, AI, and real-time decision-making we turn energy complexity into growth opportunities for our partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable and affordable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Pre-Sales Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you are a "developer-plus" technical contributor. You are responsible for building high-quality mock backends, APIs, and demo infrastructure, but with a unique twist: you leverage &lt;strong&gt;LLMs and Generative AI&lt;/strong&gt; to prototype at high velocity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the critical boundary between Product Engineering and Go-to-Market. While you won't build production systems, you will build "production-shaped" assets: reusable, well-structured, and documented services that enable credible technical storytelling and high-fidelity client validation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your core responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Accelerated Prototyping: &lt;/strong&gt;Leverage LLMs (e.g., Claude and Gemini) to rapidly scaffold, build, and iterate on proof-of-concept apps and mock services. You move faster than a traditional sprint by using AI to handle the "heavy lifting" of boilerplate and logic generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Asset Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Design, build, and maintain reusable mock services in Node.js / TypeScript. You’ll implement contract-first APIs (REST/GraphQL), manage AWS deployments (API Gateway, Containers), and handle persistence using PostgreSQL or DynamoDB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure as Code: &lt;/strong&gt;Manage demo environments using Terraform, ensuring environments are reproducible and secure using existing OIDC authentication patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frontend Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Work closely with frontend engineers to ensure UI components point cleanly to your mock services, debugging integration issues and supporting end-to-end demo flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Pre-Sales Support: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with Pre-Sales consultants to translate client "win themes" into working technical artefacts. You will occasionally demo directly to clients, showcasing how Kaluza solves their specific retail challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; UX Influence: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with Design and Product teams for UI direction while developing your own design ideas to make Kaluza’s capabilities shine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship &amp;amp; Standards: &lt;/strong&gt;Set informal engineering standards for the pre-sales team, mentoring others on API design and architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Evangelism:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the resident expert in GenAI workflows for the Commercial team, mentoring others on how to use AI to bridge the gap between "slide-ware" and "software."&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What this role is NOT:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A pure presentation-led role (you will be writing code regularly).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shipping production code (your value comes from building things that&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;work&lt;/em&gt; for a demo, not maintaining production SLOs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a software engineer by trade but a prototyper by heart. You understand the rigour of clean code but know when to lean into AI to accelerate delivery. You are motivated by the immediate impact of winning new clients and validating Kaluza’s value proposition in real-time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideally you’ll have/be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineering Foundation:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong hands-on experience in &lt;strong&gt;Node.js / TypeScript&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;React&lt;/strong&gt;. You know how to write code from scratch, which is why you’re so good at prompting AI to do it for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GenAI Power User:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep experience leveraging &lt;strong&gt;LLMs and Generative AI&lt;/strong&gt; to build apps, debug complex issues, and accelerate the development lifecycle. You aren't just using an AI assistant; you are "vibe coding" complete PoCs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;API Design Expert:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience designing clean, well-documented APIs (REST and/or GraphQL) and using Git/Github workflows effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; Infrastructure Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with AWS primitives and a proven ability to deploy infrastructure using &lt;strong&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatic &amp;amp; Autonomous:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable operating with ambiguity, translating vague client requirements into working systems through a high degree of initiative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will set you apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The "Prototyper" Portfolio:&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of building internal tools, sales demos, or high-fidelity PoCs using AI-first workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Energy Sector Insight:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding the specific challenges facing energy retailers globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Auth &amp;amp; Security Savvy:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical knowledge of OIDC-based authentication flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; A talent for sharing UX/UI design thinking with wider product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you'll work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer flexible working, with an expectation of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;From us you’ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary Bonus Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance + Virtual GP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Furthr - a Climate Action app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free Mortgage Advice and Eye Tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perks at Work - access to thousands of retail discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5% Flex Fund to spend on the benefits you want most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible bank holidays, giving you an additional 8 days which you can choose to take whenever you like&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;With no qualifying service periods, including up to 26 weeks full pay for primary caregivers and 4 weeks full pay for secondary caregivers when welcoming a new addition to your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedicated personal learning and home office budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And more…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life — our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We understand some people may not apply for jobs unless they tick every box. But if you're excited about joining us and think you have some of what we're looking for, even if you're not 100% sure, we'd still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more about working at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="http://kaluza.com/" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=http://kaluza.com&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1771491345539000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3WJNf-hYazKMsvCvi8cxE9"&gt;Kaluza&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://kaluza-dev.webflow.io/careers" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://kaluza-dev.webflow.io/careers&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1771491345539000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1QXSmKgWrSGh4g0Q72N28j"&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1771491345539000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw0bjbBTtdtv8a5FsAaO5RBc"&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You can also find our Applicant Data Protection Policy &lt;a href="https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
