arbeitnow:senior-financial-crime-investi:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://monzo.com/current-account/personal"&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://monzo.com/business-banking"&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href="https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account"&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17"&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href="https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s"&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://monzo.com/flex"&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href="https://monzo.com/savings"&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://monzo.com/investments"&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://monzo.com/pensions"&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Remote in the UK 🇬🇧 | 💰 £31,100 - £39,350 (+ £2,500 Multilingual Premium) + Incentive awards tied to your performance +&lt;a href="https://monzo.com/careers/"&gt; Benefits ✨&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Date - 4th January 2027&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="2,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Shift Options Available:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="2,0,1"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="2,0,1,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="2,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Option 1 (Core Day Shift):&lt;/strong&gt; 8.5-hour shifts scheduled between 07:00 and 18:30 (includes a 1-in-4 weekend rotation, with time off in lieu during the week)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="2,0,1,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="2,0,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Option 2 (Late Shift):&lt;/strong&gt; 12:00 – 20:30 (Monday to Friday, no weekends)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We're hiring for opportunities in our Retail and Business Banking team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👋 Hey there! We're Monzo, the bank that's making money work for everyone.&lt;/strong&gt; We're all about waving goodbye to old-school banking and creating magical moments for our customers. This is an exciting time to join us as we continue to grow, and in this role as a Senior Investigator you'll play a key part in supporting our customers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑 You’ll play a key role by...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigating complex or high-risk anti-money laundering alerts on business or retail accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for recommending Suspicious Transaction Reports (STR) be by Monzo Bank EU.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making business onboarding decisions in high-risk or complex cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting ongoing due diligence on high-risk business accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing financial crime expertise and support to other operational teams across the business.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong English written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are Fluent in Spanish both written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong experience of conducting high-risk business banking screening or complex business financial crime investigations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience making independent, risk-based financial crime decisions in a regulated financial services firm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have knowledge of the current financial crime landscape in the UK and the EU, and associated financial crime risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;The working hours to be covered by the team are stated above. The start for the role will be in January 2027 and you must be able to commit to the first 8 weeks of training Monday to Friday 9am-5.30pm. No holidays/time off will be authorised during this period.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌 What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰£31,100 - £39,350 (+ £2,500 Multilingual Premium) + Incentive awards tied to your performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎂 We guarantee to approve time off on your birthday if it falls on a day you’re scheduled to work and it’s outside of your training period.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍 This role is remote based in the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚£1,000 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏡 We will set you up to work from home; all employees are given Macbooks and for fully remote workers we will provide extra support for your work-from-home setup.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕ Plus lots more!&lt;a href="https://monzo.com/careers/"&gt; Read our full list of benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌈 Ready to join the Monzo adventure?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply now and help us make money work for everyone in the EU!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The application journey has 4 key steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Application questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call with a Recruiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take home task to assess your financial crime knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview to discuss your previous experience and technical knowledge and values &amp;amp; language assessment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want you to feel confident and put your best foot forward during the interview process. We’ve put together a &lt;a href="https://www.notion.so/monzo/Monzonaut-Interviews-how-to-prepare-30569fe426d280d281b0daf2a4646df2"&gt;prep guide here&lt;/a&gt; with tips on how to prepare for your interview - please take a look!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This process should take around 2-3 weeks - your schedule is really important to us, so we promise to be as flexible as possible!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have some guidelines on using Artificial Intelligence (AI) to ace an application and interview at Monzo. &lt;a href="https://monzo.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-on-using-ai-to-ace-an-interview-at-monzo"&gt;You can read them here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href="https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion"&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href="https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report" target="_blank"&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href="https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025"&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don't need full or birth names at application stage 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:inbound-account-executive-dutc:
&lt;h1 data-start="121" data-end="191"&gt;💼 Inbound Account Executive – Netherlands (On-Site – London)&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-start="193" data-end="305"&gt;Ready to grow your sales career in one of the world’s leading fintech scale-ups — while owning the Dutch market?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="307" data-end="472"&gt;Join our &lt;strong data-start="316" data-end="348"&gt;Inbound Sales Team in London&lt;/strong&gt;, where you’ll turn warm leads into happy customers and help small businesses across &lt;strong data-start="433" data-end="452"&gt;the Netherlands&lt;/strong&gt; succeed with SumUp.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="474" data-end="755"&gt;At SumUp, we believe small merchants are the heart of the economy. That’s why we build intuitive, affordable tools that make getting paid simple. With over 4 million businesses using SumUp across 30+ countries, we’re shaping the future of payments — and we want you on the journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="757" data-end="1007"&gt;As an &lt;strong data-start="762" data-end="812"&gt;Inbound Account Executive – Netherlands&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll work with inbound leads from the Dutch market, guiding small and medium-sized businesses through their first steps with SumUp and helping them choose the right solutions for their needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="757" data-end="1007"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start="1014" data-end="1034"&gt;🎯 What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1036" data-end="1149"&gt;💬 Engage with inbound leads generated by our marketing team in the Netherlands — qualify, consult, and convert&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1151" data-end="1264"&gt;📞 Connect with small and medium-sized businesses via phone and email, building trust in both English and Dutch&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1266" data-end="1369"&gt;🎤 Deliver tailored product demos and clearly explain how SumUp solves real-world business challenges&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1371" data-end="1472"&gt;📈 Manage your pipeline in Salesforce, ensuring structured follow-ups and efficient lead conversion&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1474" data-end="1569"&gt;📊 Track your performance, report on results, and stay aligned with team and regional targets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1571" data-end="1683"&gt;🤝 Collaborate with the wider European sales team to share insights about the Dutch market and customer trends&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1571" data-end="1683"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start="1690" data-end="1724"&gt;👀 You’ll Be a Great Fit If You&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1726" data-end="1810"&gt;✔ Speak &lt;strong data-start="1734" data-end="1770"&gt;Dutch fluently (C2/native level)&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start="1775" data-end="1808"&gt;English at professional level&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1812" data-end="1916"&gt;✔ Have experience in a phone-based or customer-facing role (sales, support, retail, hospitality, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1918" data-end="1981"&gt;✔ Feel confident engaging business owners and decision-makers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1983" data-end="2064"&gt;✔ Are curious about fintech and motivated to understand the Dutch SMB landscape&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2066" data-end="2124"&gt;✔ Thrive in a fast-paced, performance-driven environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2126" data-end="2224"&gt;✔ Bring a proactive, team-first attitude and enjoy contributing to a collaborative sales culture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2226" data-end="2339"&gt;Bonus points for experience with payments, POS/EPOS software, SaaS, or Excel — but we’ll teach you what you need.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start="2346" data-end="2366"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start="2346" data-end="2366"&gt;🌟 Why Join SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2368" data-end="2466"&gt;💸 &lt;strong&gt;Competitive base salary + uncapped commission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start="2416" data-end="2419"&gt;Your earning potential grows with your success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2468" data-end="2580"&gt;🌍 &lt;strong&gt;Own a Key European Market&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start="2496" data-end="2499"&gt;Develop commercial expertise while managing relationships across the Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2582" data-end="2713"&gt;🏢 &lt;strong&gt;Office-first Setup in Central London&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start="2621" data-end="2624"&gt;Work face-to-face with your team and be part of a growing, high-energy sales environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2715" data-end="2833"&gt;📚 &lt;strong&gt;€2,000 Annual Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start="2747" data-end="2750"&gt;Invest in your professional development through courses, events, or certifications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2835" data-end="2926"&gt;🧘 &lt;strong&gt;30-Day Paid Sabbatical&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start="2860" data-end="2863"&gt;After 3 years with us, take a fully paid month off to recharge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="2928" data-end="3034"&gt;🌈 &lt;strong&gt;Diverse &amp;amp; Inclusive Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start="2958" data-end="2961"&gt;Be part of an international team where different perspectives are valued.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3036" data-end="3106"&gt;💸 &lt;strong&gt;Referral Bonus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start="3053" data-end="3056"&gt;Know someone amazing? Refer them and get rewarded.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3113" data-end="3249"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This isn’t just a sales role&lt;/strong&gt; — it’s your opportunity to build commercial expertise in fintech while owning an important European market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="3251" data-end="3404" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node=""&gt;If you’re excited about fintech, love working with people, and want to grow your career in an international environment, apply now and join us in London.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;We believe in the everyday hero.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Small business owners are at the heart of all we do, so we create powerful, easy-to-use financial solutions to help them run their businesses. With a founder’s mentality and a 'team-first’ attitude, our diverse teams across Europe, South America and the United States work together to ensure that the small business owners we partner with can be successful doing what they love.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;SumUp is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer that proudly pursues and hires a diverse workforce. SumUp does not make hiring or employment decisions on the basis of race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. SumUp also strives for a healthy and safe workplace and strictly prohibits harassment of any kind.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;SumUp will not accept unsolicited resumes from any source other than directly from a candidate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:staff-software-engineer-partne:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;h2 data-pm-slice="1 1 []"&gt;About Crunchyroll&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded by fans, Crunchyroll delivers the art and culture of anime to a passionate community. We super-serve over 100 million anime and manga fans across 200+ countries and territories, and help them connect with the stories and characters they crave. Whether that experience is online or in-person, streaming video, theatrical, games, merchandise, events and more, it’s powered by the anime content we all love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team, and help us shape the future of anime!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Crunchyroll is scaling globally, creating unique challenges and exciting opportunities to delight millions of anime fans worldwide. The Partner Engineering team, part of the larger Ecosystem Engineering organization, works with our growing network of partners and internal teams to ensure an exceptional experience for all Crunchyroll fans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Partner Engineer, you'll lead strategic technical integrations, optimize deployment processes, and collaborate with key partners to deliver outstanding user experiences. You'll act as the technical point of contact for our partners, driving innovation and solving complex challenges with scalable, forward-thinking solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this high-impact role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional projects involving Product, Engineering, Business Development, Program Management, and Marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve and scale existing partner operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and commercialize new partner-facing solutions and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accelerate new initiatives by building and iterating through the full product development cycle, prototyping, testing, and launching successful features.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and bridge product gaps to enable seamless partner integration.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the Senior Manager of Partner Engineering and must be based in the London Area. This is a hybrid role with 3 days a week in the office (Tuesdays, Wednesdays, and Thursdays).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About You&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re excited about candidates who bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience building and deploying complex systems in collaboration with external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern web technologies: JavaScript, TypeScript, Node.js, HTML5, React, and WebSockets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Client/Server architectures and scalable system design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building backend services and APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to confidently engage both technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner facing experience across technical and business domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating payment systems, metadata and other B2B APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform development experience with Android TV or browser based TV platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with embedded devices, OEMs, SoC providers, or pay TV operators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Ecosystem Engineering team at Crunchyroll plays a pivotal role in enhancing and expanding our users' experiences. We collaborate extensively with a diverse network of partners to integrate, test, deploy, and improve the Crunchyroll streaming application, content discovery APIs, and billing integration APIs over the entire device lifecycle using Crunchyroll tools and data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We're focused on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving subscriber growth through new device integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opening new acquisition and distribution channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering high-quality, consistent user experiences across all platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovating in the highly competitive global streaming market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Situated at the crossroads of technology and business, we are dedicated to continually enabling experiences that delight anime fans across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you will love working at Crunchyroll&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to getting to work with fun, passionate and inspired colleagues, you will also enjoy the following benefits and perks:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive a great compensation package including salary plus performance bonus earning potential, paid annually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible time off policies allowing you to take the time you need to be your whole self.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous medical, dental, vision, STD, LTD, and life insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Saving Account HSA program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health care and dependent care FSA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) plan, with employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer paid commuter benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support program for new parents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pet insurance and some of our offices are pet friendly!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LifeAtCrunchyroll #LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;h3 data-pm-slice="1 1 []"&gt;About our Values&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to be everything for someone rather than something for everyone and we do this by living and modeling our values in all that we do. We value&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Courage. We believe that when we overcome fear, we enable our best selves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Curiosity. We are curious, which is the gateway to empathy, inclusion, and understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kaizen. We have a growth mindset committed to constant forward progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Service. We serve our community with humility, enabling joy and belonging for others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our commitment to diversity and inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission of helping people belong reflects our commitment to diversity &amp;amp; inclusion. It's just the way we do business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at Crunchyroll. Pursuant to applicable law, we do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Crunchyroll, LLC is an independently operated joint venture between US-based Sony Pictures Entertainment, and Japan's Aniplex, a subsidiary of Sony Music Entertainment (Japan) Inc., both subsidiaries of Tokyo-based Sony Group Corporation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type="italic"&gt;Questions about Crunchyroll’s hiring process? Please check out our Hiring FAQs:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type="italic"&gt;&lt;a href="https://help.crunchyroll.com/hc/en-us/articles/360040471712-Crunchyroll-Hiring-FAQs"&gt;https://help.crunchyroll.com/hc/en-us/articles/360040471712-Crunchyroll-Hiring-FAQs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type="italic"&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;Candidate Privacy Policy for more information about how we process your personal information, and your data protection rights: &lt;a href="https://tbcdn.talentbrew.com/company/22978/v1_0/docs/spe-jobs-privacy-policy-update-for-crpa-dec-21-22.pdf"&gt;https://tbcdn.talentbrew.com/company/22978/v1_0/docs/spe-jobs-privacy-policy-update-for-crpa-dec-21-22.pdf&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please beware of recent scams to online job seekers. Those applying to our job openings will only be contacted directly from ----- email account.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:staff-software-engineer-androi:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Silicon Valley, California, Archer is a leader in the next-gen aerospace sector building an end-to-end advanced air mobility platform that delivers air taxis, unmanned aircraft systems (“UAS”), aviation-related physical artificial intelligence (“AI”) solutions, and other technologies to customers worldwide across the commercial aerospace and defense sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Our sights are set high and our problems are hard, and we believe that diversity in the workplace is what makes us smarter, drives better insights, and will ultimately lift us all to success. We are dedicated to cultivating an equitable and inclusive environment that embraces our differences, and supports and celebrates all of our team members.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="line-height: 1.4;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Archer is best known for Midnight, our electric aircraft. This role isn't on that program. The AI Products Org builds consumer software for the general aviation industry. There's a lot we're not ready to talk about publicly yet, so this posting stays vague on purpose. What we can say: the products are real, they ship, and people use them every day.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 1.4;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;As the Staff Android Engineer, you'll own the Android app of a mature consumer product — one that's been featured in the app stores multiple times and has a real user base that opens it every day. The iOS and Android apps are close to feature parity, and in a couple of places Android is ahead. You'd own the Android side: new features, refinements, and keeping both platforms moving together as the product evolves.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class="p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested" data-stringify-type="unordered-list" data-list-tree="true" data-indent="0" data-border="0"&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;" data-stringify-indent="0" data-stringify-border="0"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Own the Android app of a mature, production consumer product: new features, refinements, and keeping it in step with iOS as both evolve. You'll be reading Swift regularly, even if you never write it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;" data-stringify-indent="0" data-stringify-border="0"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Make the parity-vs-platform-convention call constantly, and defend your reasoning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;" data-stringify-indent="0" data-stringify-border="0"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Ship. Play Store releases, crash triage, performance on the long tail of Android hardware — the unglamorous parts are part of the job&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;" data-stringify-indent="0" data-stringify-border="0"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Work on new and different projects (mobile, web apps, internal tools) as opportunities come up across the org. This is where the generalist part of your skill set earns its keep&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;" data-stringify-indent="0" data-stringify-border="0"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Work the way this team works: AI-assisted development is the default here, not a novelty. We use Claude Code daily and expect you to be fluent with agentic coding tools — or to get fluent fast and honestly, we'll be able to tell which&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class="p-rich_text_section"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="p-rich_text_section"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="p-rich_text_section"&gt;
&lt;ul class="p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested" data-stringify-type="unordered-list" data-list-tree="true" data-indent="0" data-border="0"&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;" data-stringify-indent="0" data-stringify-border="0"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;7+ years of software engineering experience, mostly on user-facing client software that shipped in the Play Store&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;" data-stringify-indent="0" data-stringify-border="0"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Bachelor's, or equivalent experience in Computer Science&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;" data-stringify-indent="0" data-stringify-border="0"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Solid Kotlin experience, and enough compose to have opinions about it&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;" data-stringify-indent="0" data-stringify-border="0"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Real 0→1 experience — you've built the first version of something, not just contributed to a long-lived codebase someone else stood up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
