&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class="ak-ul" data-local-id="5cd8d97926b2" data-indent-level="1"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos="3599" data-local-id="a7528ecc8dba"&gt;Designing held-out, out-of-domain, and change-impact evaluations that test new or removed models, providers, skills, and harness versions&lt;/p&gt;
