&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class="ak-ul" data-local-id="a8e4c8894548" data-indent-level="1"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos="3742" data-local-id="b83d00176464"&gt;Investigating distillation, self-improving harnesses, multi-agent training, agent factories, and automated skill creation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class="ak-ul" data-local-id="ba52a39de1c2" data-indent-level="1"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos="3869" data-local-id="45bba6b0fc15"&gt;Writing robust research software, APIs, integration layers, and test infrastructure that enable rapid but reproducible experimentation&lt;/p&gt;
