&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class="ak-ul" data-local-id="0a2544bc8a48" data-indent-level="1"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos="4598" data-local-id="e5ab4d7919f3"&gt;Experience building and evaluating modern language-model or agentic systems, including tool use and multi-turn workflows&lt;/p&gt;
