&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expert in front-end frameworks&lt;/strong&gt; such as React, Next.js, Tailwind.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience in CMS platforms&lt;/strong&gt; (such as Contentful and Sanity) and marketing tools (e.g. Google Tag Manager, Marketo)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
