&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;infrastructure as code&lt;/strong&gt; tools such as &lt;strong&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt;, and cloud platforms like &lt;strong&gt;AWS (Vercel, CloudFront, S3, etc.)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience with A/B testing&lt;/strong&gt; and familiarity with analytics tools to drive data-informed design and development decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge of performance optimization&lt;/strong&gt; techniques and best practices for fast-loading, responsive websites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience in writing tests&lt;/strong&gt; for front-end components, with familiarity in testing frameworks (e.g., Jest, Mocha, Cypress).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong problem-solving skills&lt;/strong&gt; and the ability to work independently and as part of a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree&lt;/strong&gt; in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field (or equivalent practical experience).&lt;/li&gt;
