pan&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0"&gt; and security products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0"&gt; is communicated effectively to all stakeholders. By combining &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0"&gt;expertise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0"&gt; in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0"&gt;complia&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0"&gt;nce requirements with a customer-centric approach, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0"&gt;Security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0"&gt; Product Manager helps position security as a competitive advantage rather than just an internal obligation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW150279474 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
