arbeitnow:lead-product-designer-ui-desig:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Lead Product Designer – UI &amp;amp; Design Systems&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London (Hybrid) | &lt;strong&gt;Practice Area:&lt;/strong&gt; Product &amp;amp; Experience | &lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;Design with clarity. Create with purpose. Build experiences that scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;Capco is a global technology and business consultancy focused on the financial services and energy sectors. Our Product &amp;amp; Experience team translates strategy into intuitive digital products and engaging customer experiences that transform businesses and impact millions of users worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;As a Lead Product Designer specialising in UI and Design Systems, you'll create exceptional digital experiences while building scalable design foundations that enable consistency across products, platforms, and teams.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;You'll embrace AI-enabled ways of working, using approved AI tools where appropriate to enhance design quality and accelerate delivery while applying sound professional judgement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;Working across multidisciplinary teams, you'll establish and evolve enterprise design systems, strengthen collaboration between design and engineering, and help clients deliver accessible, user-centred digital products at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You'll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread="false"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Craft exceptional interfaces across responsive web, mobile, and enterprise products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate user journeys, wireframes, and product requirements into high-quality visual and interaction designs,&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;using approved AI-enabled design tools where appropriate to support ideation and productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, evolve, and scale enterprise design systems, including reusable components, design tokens, patterns, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with UX designers, researchers, product managers, and engineers to deliver consistent, scalable experiences from concept through implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present design decisions to stakeholders, facilitate workshops, mentor designers, and champion design excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We're Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread="false"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong portfolio demonstrating exceptional UI, visual, and interaction design across complex digital products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in typography, layout, responsive design, interaction design, prototyping, accessibility, and enterprise design systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in Figma, inclusive design principles, and developer handover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management, communication, and collaboration skills within multidisciplinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity to explore emerging AI capabilities and apply them responsibly to improve design outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread="false"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading enterprise design systems across multiple products or business areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of design system governance, contribution models, adoption, and versioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with front-end engineers using Storybook, React, HTML, CSS, or coded component libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing complex, data-rich, or regulated digital products within financial services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of motion design, data visualisation, AI-enabled design tools, or advanced prototyping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why Join Capco&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread="false"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver high-impact technology solutions for Tier 1 financial institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a collaborative, flat, and entrepreneurial consulting culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access continuous learning, training, and industry certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a team shaping the future of digital financial services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the future of digital transformation across Financial Services &amp;amp; Energy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;We offer a competitive, people-first benefits package designed to support every aspect of your life:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread="false"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Discretionary bonus, competitive pension, health insurance, life insurance and critical illness cover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental Health:&lt;/strong&gt; Easy access to CareFirst, Unmind, Aviva consultations, and in-house first aiders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family-Friendly:&lt;/strong&gt; Maternity, adoption, shared parental leave, plus paid leave for sickness, pregnancy loss, fertility treatment, menopause, and bereavement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family Care:&lt;/strong&gt; Eight complimentary backup care sessions for emergency childcare or elder care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Holiday Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Five weeks of annual leave with the option to buy or sell holiday days based on your needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Learning:&lt;/strong&gt; Minimum 40 Hours of Training Annually: Take your pick- workshops, certifications, e-learning- your growth, your way. Business Coach assigned from Day One to accelerate your development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Healthcare Access:&lt;/strong&gt; Convenient online GP services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extra Perks:&lt;/strong&gt; Gympass (Wellhub), travel insurance, Tastecard, season ticket loans, Cycle to Work, and dental insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Inclusion at Capco&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We're committed to making our recruitment process accessible and straightforward for everyone. If you need any adjustments at any stage, just let us know- we'll be happy to help. We value each person's unique perspective and contribution. At Capco, we believe that being yourself is your greatest strength. Our&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;#BeYourselfAtWork culture encourages individuality and collaboration, shaping how we work with clients and each other every day.&lt;/p&gt;
