&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id="p-rc_f8e923bbc18c0cc5-194" data-path-to-node="18,1,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="18,1,0,0"&gt;Deep expertise in image editing and design tools such as Adobe Illustrator and Photoshop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="18,1,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
