&lt;p id="p-rc_f8e923bbc18c0cc5-199" data-path-to-node="21,2,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="21,2,0,0"&gt;Active creative collaboration with design teams to co&lt;span class="citation-72 citation-73 citation-end-73"&gt;ntinually elevate Moniepoint's visual language and illustration standards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="21,2,0,2"&gt;&lt;span class="citation-70 citation-71 citation-end-71"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
