&lt;p id="p-rc_f8e923bbc18c0cc5-200" data-path-to-node="21,3,0"&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="21,3,0,0"&gt;&lt;span class="citation-68 citation-69 citation-end-69"&gt;Reliable and on-time delivery of high-quality illustrations that satisfy complex cross-functional briefs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="21,3,0,2"&gt;&lt;span class="citation-66 citation-67 citation-end-67"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
